0470#issuecomment-3289462894","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110470","id":3289462894,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7EEThu","user":{"login":"rsubtil","id":6501975,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1MDE5NzU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6501975?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil","html_url":"https://github.com/rsubtil","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-14T11:23:31Z","updated_at":"2025-09-14T11:23:31Z","body":"> This behavior is expected because the CPU you are using is not powerful enough to run the editor on Android.\n\nI don't think this can be ruled out yet. My phone's CPU (Snapdragon 662) seems similar in power to Moto G20's CPU (UNISOC Tangula T700), and I have no such freeze issues (using 2D platformer demo).\n\nPlease provide a few more details on your setup. Does this occur when editing a blank project? Does this happen on a stable version too? Does this also occur if you change the rendering preset to Mobile (aka Vulkan)?","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3289462894/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://